      69.84,
      493.44,
      310.0,
      551.51
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964 (Amendment) that theGovernment intends to acquire the following lands whichare required for Establishment of the Police Station -Kandanegedara.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
