      587.04,
      309.76,
      645.11
    ],
    "text": "The allotments of land in total extent of 0.8093 Hectaredepicted in Supplement No. 12 Sheet No. 10 of F.V.P.292and in Supplement No. 08 sheet No. 08 F.V.P.293 situatedin the Village called Horothepola, Wadumunegedara inMedapattuwa Basnahira Korale in the Divisional Secretary's",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
